"Connect LocalDevVPN before teleporting. Default tunnel IP is 10.7.0.1. Locus discovers the current _remotepairing._tcp port automatically when starting a new session; the last port used is shown above. Start a spoof on Wi‑Fi first; it can keep working on cellular afterward." = "修改定位前请先连接 LocalDevVPN。默认隧道 IP 为 10.7.0.1。Locus 会在新会话开始时自动发现当前 _remotepairing._tcp 端口，上方会显示最近一次使用的端口。首次模拟请在 Wi‑Fi 下启动，之后可继续使用蜂窝网络。";
"Import an RPPairing file from idevice_pair (not a SideStore lockdown .mobiledevicepairing). If the file picker fails (common in LiveContainer), enable Fix File Picker on the app, share the file into LiveContainer → Locus, or copy the plist and use Paste." = "请导入 idevice_pair 生成的 RPPairing 文件（不是 SideStore lockdown 的 .mobiledevicepairing）。如果文件选择器失败（LiveContainer 中较常见），请启用 Fix File Picker，或将文件共享到 LiveContainer → Locus，也可以复制 plist 内容后使用粘贴。";
"Locus needs a one-time pairing so it can set your location. You’ll confirm a short code in Settings." = "Locus 需要进行一次配对才能修改定位。你需要在系统设置中确认一个简短的配对码。";
"Import a pairing file from your computer — Locus uses it to set your location securely on this device." = "从电脑导入配对文件，Locus 会使用它在此设备上安全地修改定位。";
"On a Mac, run idevice_pair and create an RPPairing file." = "在 Mac 上运行 idevice_pair 并创建 RPPairing 文件。";
"AirDrop / Share into Locus, or copy the plist text." = "通过隔空投送/共享导入 Locus，或复制 plist 文本。";
"Tap Import, or Paste from clipboard if the picker doesn’t work (LiveContainer)." = "点击导入；如果文件选择器不可用（如 LiveContainer），可从剪贴板粘贴。";
"LocalDevVPN is installed. Open it to turn on the private tunnel Locus needs, then come back here." = "LocalDevVPN 已安装。打开它并启用 Locus 所需的本地隧道，然后返回这里。";
"LocalDevVPN creates a private tunnel Locus uses to talk to your phone’s location system. Install it, turn it on, then you’re ready to teleport." = "LocalDevVPN 会创建一条本地隧道，让 Locus 与 iPhone 的定位系统通信。安装并开启后即可修改定位。";
"LocalDevVPN is on this iPhone." = "此 iPhone 已安装 LocalDevVPN。";
"Tap below to open it and start the tunnel. You’ll bounce back to Locus." = "点击下方打开并启动隧道，然后返回 Locus。";
"Get LocalDevVPN from the App Store." = "从 App Store 获取 LocalDevVPN。";
"Open it and turn the VPN on. Leave the default IP alone." = "打开后启用 VPN，保持默认 IP 即可。";
"Start your first teleport while on Wi‑Fi. After that, it can keep working on cellular." = "首次修改定位请在 Wi‑Fi 下进行，成功后可继续在蜂窝网络下使用。";
"Locus advertises a pairable host. iOS connects from Developer Mode, then Locus shows a 6-digit code for you to type." = "Locus 会广播一个可配对主机。iOS 从开发者模式连接后，Locus 会显示一个需要输入的 6 位配对码。";
"Keep Locus open. You’ll leave briefly for Settings, then come back with a code." = "保持 Locus 打开。你需要短暂进入系统设置，然后回来查看配对码。";
"Tap Start pairing and allow Local Network + Location when asked." = "点击开始配对，并在提示时允许本地网络和定位权限。";
"Allow notifications — the code can appear as a banner over Settings." = "允许通知，配对码可以在系统设置界面上方以横幅显示。";
"Open Settings › Privacy & Security › Developer Mode › Pair with Locus → Pair." = "打开 设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 开发者模式 › 与 Locus 配对 → 配对。";
"Enter your unlock passcode first. On the next prompt, type Locus’s 6-digit code." = "先输入设备解锁密码，然后在下一个提示中输入 Locus 的 6 位配对码。";
"If the code isn’t here yet" = "如果还没有显示配对码";
"In Developer Mode tap Pair with Locus → Pair." = "在开发者模式中点击“与 Locus 配对”→“配对”。";
"Second prompt only — after your unlock passcode." = "仅在第二个提示中输入——先完成设备解锁密码验证。";
"Next we’ll set up LocalDevVPN." = "下一步将设置 LocalDevVPN。";
"RPPairing file saved. Connect LocalDevVPN, then teleport." = "RPPairing 文件已保存。连接 LocalDevVPN 后即可修改定位。";
"Import an RPPairing file in Settings first." = "请先在设置中导入 RPPairing 文件。";
"Drop a pin or teleport somewhere before using the joystick." = "使用摇杆前，请先放置定位点或修改一次定位。";

